[8.925154, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.925329, "o", "Manage and use extensions.\r\nUsage: use <path|subcommand> [args]\r\nSubcommands:\r\n  <path>              Load an extension from the specified path\r\n  list                List all loaded extensions\r\n  unload <name>       Unload a specific extension\r\n  execute <name> [command] [args...] Execute an extension with arguments\r\n  status <task-id>    Check the result of an extension execution task\r\n  help                Display this help message\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  use /tmp/extensions/rubeus     Load the Rubeus extension\r\n  use list                       List loaded extensions\r\n  use execute rubeus triage      Execute Rubeus with 'triage' command\r\n  use execute ps_killer kill pid=1234  Execute with arguments\r\n  use status task-123            Check the result of a task\r\n  use unload rubeus              Unload the Rubeus extension\r\nvirga> "]
[9.410544, "o", "\r\nGoodbye!\r\n"]
